      "en": "and said, ‘For this cause a man shall leave his father and mother, and shall be joined to his wife; and the two shall become one flesh’?",
      "ko": "말씀하시기를 이러므로 사람이 그 부모를 떠나서 아내에게 합하여 그 둘이 한 몸이 될찌니라 하신 것을 읽지 못하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "be0582d3cdf7160eeb4ba543ddf9daa01cbd275fcd8746dfade30a2dda14c9a4",
      "translation_text_hash": "cef32f3dd92d864a448ca0c821d1054cf5b6299972e71da1fe8150e5b9637c51",
