      "en": "I tell you that whoever divorces his wife, except for sexual immorality, and marries another, commits adultery; and he who marries her when she is divorced commits adultery.”",
      "ko": "내가 너희에게 말하노니 누구든지 음행한 연고 외에 아내를 내어버리고 다른데 장가 드는 자는 간음함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "09a53e45686f17123f1d19327c5ea3094a907c545338bd307ac457178d75b0bc",
      "translation_text_hash": "e3b51a83a0a3e7ee4377f4e46a795ec4ae25e50a3ebe4d7f910314f4b8c966ac",
