      "en": "For there are eunuchs who were born that way from their mother’s womb, and there are eunuchs who were made eunuchs by men; and there are eunuchs who made themselves eunuchs for the Kingdom of Heaven’s sake. He who is able to receive it, let him receive it.”",
      "ko": "어미의 태로부터 된 고자도 있고 사람이 만든 고자도 있고 천국을 위하여 스스로 된 고자도 있도다 이 말을 받을만한 자는 받을찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "fad694c33d70866b1e4ecd6be188e74939e021f9ce716a06b0191c26055f2c93",
      "translation_text_hash": "07b9331528c937d149b29eef35081d5ae946bc16c445fc7cd99036d7aef9287d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
